  "stageId": "act5d0_04",
  "title": "7:59P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-4",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "15d9ddca700a88230ced503c433fc9cb2cb80aabc7d806c5ebea973e02dea664",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）\n7:59 P.M. \\ Cloudy\nLungmen Aqueduct, Pier"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stranger",
      "text": "Now don't go jumping onto any more boats! It's dangerous!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Sorry, it's just, we were...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "By the way, you didn't happen to see a Sankta lady around here, did you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stranger",
      "text": "I didn't see anything. And I don't have time for this. These sweets are for the after party and are you gonna pay me if they turn up late... Oh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stranger",
      "text": "A S- Sankta...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Ah! Mostim——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Mostima? You know Mostima?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Sorry. I mistook you for someone else.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "(This lady sure looks familiar.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stranger",
      "text": "Ahem. Anyway, I'll let you off this time. But don't go doing anything that dangerous ever again.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "S- sorry. I didn't mean to trouble you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Hm... Forte kid... there was something about a Forte kid... what was it...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Oh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Aaah! What are you doing?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "You had some candy on your horn.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Oh, really? I should probably give it back to...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "And looking at your horns reminded me of something! They're just like the Mountain Dash Logistics logo!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "You're the little prince of MDL, aren't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Little... prince...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Sora, ma'am, is this really the way back to Texas and the others?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Relax, I know what Texas is thinking at all times. I can see right into her head.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Oh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "...her voice has such a familiar quality to it, but I can't put my finger on it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "'Ma'am,' huh? Hehe, I never thought the day would come when young Messengers would be calling me that~ So what's your impression of everybody?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Impression?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "They're very... um... spirited people.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Ahahaha... I can guess what they must've put you through...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Oh, sorry!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "Watch where you're going! Ptoo!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "That was clearly your fault——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "text": "Who asked you? Mind your own business!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "You little brat!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Don't worry about it. Let him go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "But he just swiped your wallet——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Hehe, he sure did. But that wallet just had some pumpkin candies inside. See? This is the real one~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "You familiar with the old expression 'trick or treat'?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "He was here just to make trouble, and today's not even... why would you have something like that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "You may not be able to tell at first glance, but Lungmen's been through a lot lately.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Sauin candles aren't bright enough to light up all the dark corners of this city, and those kids don't exactly have it easy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "But hey, it's just something I came up with. Not bad, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "What if he grabbed my wallet instead...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Should be right up ahead.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Isn't this... the park from before? Did we just make a big circle?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "See? Here they are.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "Mmmh! Mmff mff!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Listen, if you don't talk, I'm gonna have to light this fuse.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Yer lips better start flappin', kiddo. These fireworks'll blow ya sky high.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "...You forgot to take the tape off his mouth.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Oh, right. Haha.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "——————!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "You crazy broads! Do you have any idea who we are?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "...the Siracusan Mafia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "Urk, T- Texas...? Don't think we're scared of you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Oh we know you're not scared. Why else would you blow up all the boss's collectibles. A bomb in a candy box, though? That's kids' stuff.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "...what are you talking about?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "I don't know nothin' about no candy box. But if our capo did up a bomb, you'd all be in pieces—— Mmmf! Mmmh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "This guy sure is full of himself. Let's blast him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Patience, Exusiai. Let him talk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "*Gasp*——Hah. Ain't you the least bit curious why Lungmen's lettin' us get away with all this?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Not really. As long as we go down to the station once a month to pay our property damage fines, they pretty much let us do whatever too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "Gah...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "C'mon, Exu, let the feller say his piece.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "Just look at you broads...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "We got the big man's OK to do whatever we want to Penguin Logistics, right from the real power in Lungmen. You know what that means, don't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "We're a legitimate logistics business? And a pretty good one at that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Then why do we always end up... You know what? Forget it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Who's 'the big man' you're talking about?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "It sounds really pretentious. Super gross.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "Don't play dumb! The Rat King's——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Hey! Texas! And the rest!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Oh, Sora! What's up~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "How about that. She wrangled Bison too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Hehe, I ran into this lost little calf on my way over, I thought I'd bring him along.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Um... what are you doing? And where's Mr. Emperor?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "The boss went somewhere to do something.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "You didn't run into anyone else, Sora?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Hm? I don't... think... so.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Huh? Do I have something on my face?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "N- no. Anyway, Bison filled me in on the whole story. Where do we go from here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "First we get some more answers from our little buddy, then we formulate an appropriate... response.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Wait, Exusiai, do you mean...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "I actually ran into Mostima back there. But then I lost her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Erm, I mean, after we shook the mobsters, she——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "...don't worry about her. That's just how she is. Vanishing years at a time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "...years?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Tell ya the truth, I barely seen heads or tails of her since they hired me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "text": "Ahaha, let's not get Exusiai too riled up...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "This is all very... unorthodox.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "She's a special kind of Messenger.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Contractually, she works for the boss, but more often Laterano has her——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "——Exusiai, watch your match.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Huh? Oops.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "MMMMH! MMF——!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Darn it, looks like we're outta time. But that's the way the cookie crumbles.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "MMMMMNG!!!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "Heyo, that sounded like Fronzo! And it didn't sound good!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "text": "Let's get over there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "So they really can send a person flying. These fireworks are something else.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "We've got company. Six and three o'clock.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
